  message: "Cross-ref 2026-11-04 (WI-jizam parity measurement, lab /home/jgstern_agent/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/self_audit_11032026/jizam_refactor_parity.txt): two surveys of one tree (dev acf67df4cb) differ in exactly two dispatches_to edges under packages/hypergumbo-core/tests/fixtures/route-parity: the go route marker at go/main.go:8 and the js marker at js-named/app.js each dispatch to go/main.go:5 listUsers in one run and to annotation/svc.js in the other. The bare-name pick this item describes is also CROSS-LANGUAGE and NONDETERMINISTIC between runs (F-hashseed-order's shape), so a route linker test that asserts a specific target on this fixture can flap."  # 6f93
